      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.81,
      "end_seconds": 10.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "yes, she was lovely about it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.58,
      "end_seconds": 15.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "How can I help you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.9,
      "end_seconds": 20.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got blurry vision."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.27,
      "end_seconds": 24.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "let me measure a few things"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.6,
      "end_seconds": 34.42,
      "duration_seconds": 0.82,
      "text": "Almost there..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.41,
      "end_seconds": 65.72,
      "duration_seconds": 11.31,
      "text": "okay: pulse is 64 beats a minute, temperature is 36.7 degrees, BP is 113 over 69. Right, how long are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.12,
      "end_seconds": 70.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "For about a year, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.79,
      "end_seconds": 75.91,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.61,
      "end_seconds": 87.7,
      "duration_seconds": 11.09,
      "text": "Yes, reading. That makes it worse. I'd call it severe. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.06,
      "end_seconds": 93.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "did you get double vision, floaters or flashes of light?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.11,
      "end_seconds": 100.23,
      "duration_seconds": 6.12,
      "text": "No double vision, floaters or flashes of light, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.96,
      "end_seconds": 104.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.6,
      "end_seconds": 107.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "no problems with breathing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.46,
      "end_seconds": 111.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Any diagnoses you've been given before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.09,
      "end_seconds": 115.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.43,
      "end_seconds": 119.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Are you still working?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.23,
      "end_seconds": 129.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "I'm retired now, I was a clerk for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.03,
      "end_seconds": 133.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Are you active at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.8,
      "end_seconds": 137.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Barely, I'm mostly sedentary these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.0,
      "end_seconds": 141.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Any drug or food allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.24,
      "end_seconds": 147.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "yeah, no allergies that I know of, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.22,
      "end_seconds": 157.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.2,
      "end_seconds": 162.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Just a C-section, about ten years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.97,
      "end_seconds": 168.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.61,
      "end_seconds": 173.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "I'm on ramipril, 5 milligrams, every morning"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.83,
      "end_seconds": 193.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "do your parents or siblings have any long-term illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.85,
      "end_seconds": 195.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "My sister has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.46,
      "end_seconds": 200.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Can I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.29,
      "end_seconds": 206.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "A little pressure here, tell me if it's tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.24,
      "end_seconds": 225.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Vision without glasses is six over twelve in both eyes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.5,
      "end_seconds": 230.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Stay still while I have a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.94,
      "end_seconds": 248.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "The lens looks a little cloudy on both sides."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.45,
      "end_seconds": 254.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.98,
      "end_seconds": 270.59,
      "duration_seconds": 6.61,
      "text": "okay, so my impression is this: My working impression is a refractive problem or early cataracts"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.95,
      "end_seconds": 277.77,
      "duration_seconds": 5.82,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.55,
      "end_seconds": 286.56,
      "duration_seconds": 8.01,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a refractive problem or early cataracts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.28,
      "end_seconds": 305.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "Today I'm not changing anything. Right, call the clinic if you need us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.89,
      "end_seconds": 310.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "I appreciate it, doctor"
    }
  ]
